review.reviewBody:
This was a fantastic recipe idea and really easy to make if you take the short route of cool whip. Changes I made were;
 1 cup heavy cream whipped with 4 oz. cream cheese and 2 tbsp sugar. I used 1/4 cup watermelon juice (heated) with the watermelon jello. Everything else was original recipe. Great looking and totally a summer treat.
I buy most my jello's on Amazon, this was Jolly Rancher Watermelon that I used.
